# Harness subagents

Use **Task tool** with these project subagents from `.cursor/agents/`:

| Subagent | When |
|----------|------|
| `pm` | Orchestrate work; never implement code directly |
| `coder` | All code changes |
| `spec-reviewer` | After coder — AC compliance |
| `reviewer` | After spec-reviewer passes — code quality |
| `tester` | After reviewer — run stack tests, QA report |
| `debugger` | Stuck after 2+ coder attempts |
| `explorer` | Map codebase before large changes |
| `solution-architect` | Architecture unclear or high-risk design |

Example: *"Use the coder subagent to implement task-042 per `.project-manager/tasks/task-042.md`"*

After subagent completes, PM updates task status and ensures After-Work is appended.
